---
---

<section class="founder">
  <div class="container founder__inner">
    <figure class="founder__portrait">
      <img src="/images/leaders/ileana-vranceanu.jpg" alt="Portrait of Ileana Vrânceanu, founder and CEO of FRAM School" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    </figure>

    <div class="founder__body">
      <p class="eyebrow">A letter from our founder</p>
      <blockquote class="pullquote founder__quote">
        FRAM began with a question I asked myself as a parent: <em>what kind of school would I want for my own child?</em>
      </blockquote>
      <p class="cite founder__cite">Ileana Vrânceanu, Founder &amp; CEO</p>
      <a href="/about/leadership#ileana-vranceanu" class="founder__link">
        Read her full message →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .founder { padding-block: clamp(3rem, 5vw + 1.5rem, 6rem); }

  .founder__inner {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    align-items: center;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .founder__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.6fr;
    }
  }

  .founder__portrait {
    margin: 0;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 4px;
    max-width: 24rem;
    background: var(--paper-deep);
  }
  .founder__portrait img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .founder__body { max-width: 38rem; }

  .founder__quote {
    margin: 1rem 0 1rem 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1rem + 2vw, 2.25rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
  }
  .founder__quote em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--brand-red);
  }

  .founder__cite { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }

  .founder__link {
    color: var(--brand-red);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .founder__link:hover { color: var(--brand-red-deep); }
</style>
